# Force LF line endings on checkout for all text files, on every platform.
# Without this, a Windows clone with git core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF, which broke
# freshness.mjs's frontmatter parser (the README tells a judge to run that tool).
# The parser is also made CRLF-tolerant as defense in depth; this makes the checkout
# itself consistent so no newline-sensitive logic can silently misbehave.
* text=auto eol=lf
